notes.content:
@1:10:25 Talks about him, and part of his story.
Basketball was an escape for him.

You are not here by accident you are here to leave your mark. It doesn't matter your story God created us. **YOU** are made in his image. Jesus had to do what Adam couldn't. 

The bible is filled with imagery of water. In this imagery we begin to see God's story, a story that   tells we were created to be filled with rivers of God's abundance life. 

The difference between us and the world is we have God with us. The world has no hope because they have a hole that only God can fill. 

@1:22:26  

$ 1st principle: A place with not water is a place with no life.
     __ALL__ scripture is given by inspiration by God. The earth cries out for God.

Millionaires have everything but still don't have peace in their soul. Peace comes from a spirit filled life.

@1:29:55 what every you thirst for will come. So don't hunger for something that's not a good diet.

As long as we are on this earth there will **ALWAYS** be an enemy after your purpose. Satan didn't care about the fruit he just wanted her identity

@1:32:31 The enemy wants you to stay inside that void that emptiness, God says nuh uh I got you 

$ 2nd Principle: A heart without the spirit... is a life with no hope
	The only thing that void and sin does is rob you from hope

@1:33:12 God wants to shake something up in you. If you step in faith God will back you. You can't be bound by fear.

@1:33:59 You are more than enough, You are valuable. **STOP COMPARING YOUR SELF** 

It does not matter what you are going through the Spirit is hovering. @1:35:10

You cant live in chaos and think you have a future.

$ 3rd Principle: God speakers to our purpose

God will set you up to win
